who would have been here tonight

00:50:07.969 --> 00:50:12.130
if he wasn't on an airplane to Dublin,<br/>Ireland, where he's relocating

00:50:12.130 --> 00:50:13.010
with his wife.

00:50:14.390 --> 00:50:17.050
John's a psychiatrist by training.<br/>He served as

00:50:17.050 --> 00:50:19.310
MetroCare CEO for almost 12 years.

00:50:19.310 --> 00:50:25.310
And he has been incredible in terms of<br/>architecting the partnership with

00:50:25.310 --> 00:50:25.890
Dallas College.

00:50:26.010 --> 00:50:30.270
Dr. Joseph, you and Dr.<br/>Cruz and your team know him so well.

00:50:31.350 --> 00:50:34.730
You know, not only did he<br/>champion the concept and

00:50:34.730 --> 00:50:38.070
the implementation of MetroCare clinics<br/>on our seven campuses,

00:50:38.570 --> 00:50:41.489
he was also a partner to Dallas<br/>College in terms of pathways

00:50:41.489 --> 00:50:45.810
of care and design of systems<br/>of care for our students.

00:50:45.810 --> 00:50:48.810
And perhaps most importantly,<br/>he opened up the clinical

00:50:48.810 --> 00:50:52.010
capacity of MetroCare,<br/>as did Parkland, as well,

00:50:52.050 --> 00:50:54.910
for our students to get<br/>the ongoing mental health

00:50:54.910 --> 00:50:56.930
care that we can't provide for them,

00:50:57.130 --> 00:50:59.530
but that they're going to<br/>need to achieve academic

00:50:59.530 --> 00:51:01.310
success and career success in this world.

00:51:01.989 --> 00:51:06.110
So the partnership between MetroCare and<br/>Dallas College has been tremendous,

00:51:06.950 --> 00:51:09.650
and Dr. Burris has been an<br/>instrumental leader in that.

00:51:09.650 --> 00:51:14.250
And he raised tens of millions of<br/>dollars to build a new clinic,

00:51:15.710 --> 00:51:18.590
a Sunrise Clinic on Hampton<br/>Road in West Dallas.

00:51:18.730 --> 00:51:21.650
He's just absolutely transformed this<br/>community and opportunities

00:51:21.650 --> 00:51:23.010
for our students to receive care.

00:51:23.330 --> 00:51:26.250
So thank you for this<br/>opportunity to acknowledge him.

00:51:27.930 --> 00:51:29.910
Thank you, Dr. Burris.

